{
    "title": "CryAnalyzer - baby translator",
    "description": "Join over 2 million users worldwide with our innovative app that analyzes crying sounds. \r\nEnjoy free access by watching ads, or subscribe for an ad-free experience.\r\n\r\nParenting is harder than you may think. \r\nThat's why we're here to assist you in understanding your baby's emotions through their cries. \r\n\r\nLet\u2019s try it when you are having trouble with a crying baby.\r\nYou can understand why your baby is crying.\r\n\r\n\u25c6 Topics\r\nWe've expanded language support in the app to include:\r\n\r\n- Arabic\r\n- Chinese\r\n- English\r\n- French\r\n- German\r\n- Hindi\r\n- Indonesian\r\n- Hindi Indonesian\r\n- Japanese\r\n- Korean\r\n- Portuguese\r\n- Russian\r\n- Spanish\r\n\r\n\u25c6 Cryanalyzer is beneficial for parents who:\r\n\u3007 Want to know whether their baby needs sleep, milk, or breastfeeding.\r\n\u3007 Want to know if the baby's crying is due to growing pains or a disturbance in their life rhythm.\r\n\u3007 Have a baby struggling to sleep even with soothing sounds.\r\n\r\n\u25c6 Cry Analyzers has over 80% accuracy in identifying a baby\u2019s emotional state from baby cry and predicts why a baby is crying.\r\n\u3007 We\u2019ve recorded and analyzed more than 20 million baby crying sounds.\r\n\r\n\u3007 The accuracy of this APP is over 80%.\r\n\r\n\u25c6 Age range of accuracy\r\nRecommended age for newborn 0-6months and you can use this APP until 2 years old.\r\n\r\n\r\n\u25c6 Reliable Infant rearing APP\r\nFIRSTASCENT INC. offers \"Cry Analyzer\". The company has collaborated with the National Center for Child Health and Development (NCCHD) to research children's lifestyles, baby growth, and development. NCCHD is the only specialized research institution for pediatric healthcare in Japan. \r\nFIRSTASCENT INC. created an algorithm capable of recording and analyzing over 20 million different baby crying sounds.\r\n\r\n\u25c6 Is your baby hungry? Is your baby sleepy? Easily understand your baby\u2019s request\r\n\u3007 The APP records the pitch and frequency of baby cry to predict the emotional state. It analyzes why the baby is crying and displays the percentage on your smartphone, guiding you on breastfeeding time.\r\n\u3007 You can easily understand your  baby\u2019s request on the display.\r\n\r\n\u25c6 Personalized for accuracy\r\n\u3007 The APP has an algorithm of the personalization. If you feed back the emotional state, it will be more accurate.\r\n\r\n\u25c6 Tracking records\r\n\u3007 You can track your baby\u2019s record. It helps you to calm and smooth your upset baby.\r\n\r\n\u25c6 Cry Analyzer will help you...\r\n\u3007 When your baby won\u2019t stop crying and you don\u2019t know what to do.\r\n\u3007 When your baby never stops crying at night.\r\n\u3007 When feeding and burping seems ineffective.\r\n\u3007 To understand your baby\u2019s request, enabling you to calm them even in public places like busy restaurants.\r\n\r\n===================================\r\n\u25a0 Contacts us\r\nIf you have any questions or inquiries, feel free to contact us through the form in the APP.\r\n\u25a0Terms of Use\r\nhttps://cry-analyzer.com/contents/term.html\r\n\u25a0Privacy Policy\r\nhttps://cry-analyzer.com/contents/privacy.html\r\n===================================",
    "descriptionHTML": "Join over 2 million users worldwide with our innovative app that analyzes crying sounds. <br>Enjoy free access by watching ads, or subscribe for an ad-free experience.<br><br>Parenting is harder than you may think. <br>That&#39;s why we&#39;re here to assist you in understanding your baby&#39;s emotions through their cries. <br><br>Let\u2019s try it when you are having trouble with a crying baby.<br>You can understand why your baby is crying.<br><br>\u25c6 Topics<br>We&#39;ve expanded language support in the app to include:<br><br>- Arabic<br>- Chinese<br>- English<br>- French<br>- German<br>- Hindi<br>- Indonesian<br>- Hindi Indonesian<br>- Japanese<br>- Korean<br>- Portuguese<br>- Russian<br>- Spanish<br><br>\u25c6 Cryanalyzer is beneficial for parents who:<br>\u3007 Want to know whether their baby needs sleep, milk, or breastfeeding.<br>\u3007 Want to know if the baby&#39;s crying is due to growing pains or a disturbance in their life rhythm.<br>\u3007 Have a baby struggling to sleep even with soothing sounds.<br><br>\u25c6 Cry Analyzers has over 80% accuracy in identifying a baby\u2019s emotional state from baby cry and predicts why a baby is crying.<br>\u3007 We\u2019ve recorded and analyzed more than 20 million baby crying sounds.<br><br>\u3007 The accuracy of this APP is over 80%.<br><br>\u25c6 Age range of accuracy<br>Recommended age for newborn 0-6months and you can use this APP until 2 years old.<br><br><br>\u25c6 Reliable Infant rearing APP<br>FIRSTASCENT INC. offers &quot;Cry Analyzer&quot;. The company has collaborated with the National Center for Child Health and Development (NCCHD) to research children&#39;s lifestyles, baby growth, and development. NCCHD is the only specialized research institution for pediatric healthcare in Japan. <br>FIRSTASCENT INC. created an algorithm capable of recording and analyzing over 20 million different baby crying sounds.<br><br>\u25c6 Is your baby hungry? Is your baby sleepy? Easily understand your baby\u2019s request<br>\u3007 The APP records the pitch and frequency of baby cry to predict the emotional state. It analyzes why the baby is crying and displays the percentage on your smartphone, guiding you on breastfeeding time.<br>\u3007 You can easily understand your  baby\u2019s request on the display.<br><br>\u25c6 Personalized for accuracy<br>\u3007 The APP has an algorithm of the personalization. If you feed back the emotional state, it will be more accurate.<br><br>\u25c6 Tracking records<br>\u3007 You can track your baby\u2019s record. It helps you to calm and smooth your upset baby.<br><br>\u25c6 Cry Analyzer will help you...<br>\u3007 When your baby won\u2019t stop crying and you don\u2019t know what to do.<br>\u3007 When your baby never stops crying at night.<br>\u3007 When feeding and burping seems ineffective.<br>\u3007 To understand your baby\u2019s request, enabling you to calm them even in public places like busy restaurants.<br><br>===================================<br>\u25a0 Contacts us<br>If you have any questions or inquiries, feel free to contact us through the form in the APP.<br>\u25a0Terms of Use<br>https://cry-analyzer.com/contents/term.html<br>\u25a0Privacy Policy<br>https://cry-analyzer.com/contents/privacy.html<br>===================================",
